{"ts":"2026-07-24T23:43:41.928Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Outcome\nCost is a function of the answer, not the archive. The same binary serves a three-item scratch project created minutes ago and a million-item workspace spanning decades, with no special mode the agent has to know about.\n\n## Why this is a milestone, not an epic\npm-9rxu is the living execution epic. This milestone is the outcome gate: it declares the scale claims the GA contract is allowed to publish.\n\n## Delivery chain\npm-801d persistent derived read index -> pm-plwm index-backed --where predicates -> pm-0qg5 item-directory fan-out -> pm-lvyd claim throughput -> pm-o79o growth policy -> pm-5qmm memory tiers for decades-old epochs. Spectrum stories pm-g2zz (large) and pm-z436 (small) are the acceptance narratives.\n\n## Explicit non-goals\nNo daemon (ADR pm-i7i4). No external database requirement for the base install. No scale mode the agent has to opt into."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-o87av6"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Outcome milestone: proven scale — sub-second bounded-token context at a million items with thousands of concurrent agents"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Milestone"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["concurrency","context-management","horizon:long","milestone","outcome","performance","scale"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-24T23:43:41.928Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-24T23:43:41.928Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2027-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":9600},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"list/context/next/get-by-filter are served from a derived index with cost proportional to the result, not the workspace; Published benchmark evidence at 1M items shows sub-second bounded-token context assembly on commodity hardware; Claim and lock throughput is measured under thousands of concurrent agents with documented contention behaviour; The small end is proven too: a three-item scratch workspace pays proportional, near-zero ceremony and token cost; History and repository growth stay bounded by an automated compaction, gc, and archival policy"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"proven-scale"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"Context assembly cost is bounded by the answer size, not the workspace size, at every scale from three items to a million"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Scale is the claim that distinguishes pm from a flat-file backlog: an agent must not pay for workspace size it never reads."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Determines whether pm can host decade-spanning, multi-team, thousands-of-agents workspaces or stays a single-repo tool."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"Published, reproducible benchmark evidence for latency, memory, token cost, and claim throughput at the million-item and thousand-agent points."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The read path still scans item files; every capability added before the index lands inherits the scan and has to be re-tuned afterwards."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-doxj"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-4k6b","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:41.928Z"},{"id":"pm-801d","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:41.928Z"},{"id":"pm-9rxu","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:41.928Z"},{"id":"pm-g2zz","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:41.928Z"},{"id":"pm-lvyd","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:41.928Z"},{"id":"pm-m08hza","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:41.928Z"},{"id":"pm-o79o","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:41.928Z"},{"id":"pm-plwm","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:41.928Z"},{"id":"pm-z436","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:41.928Z"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"d8be2452988f1b461302d29bf61b601a36dcfc42238195f518ec02365117410b","message":"File outcome milestone for the scale horizon"}
